/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
6664 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (All client-server interactions are secured using token-based authentication, TLS encryption, and role-based access control. Events such as account changes or transactions trigger background validations and audit logs to ensure compliance with GDPR and POPIA.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
6665 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Usability)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
